word overrun seems to be broken for `TextLine` (not-related to this PR, I'll fix it in a moment), so it should be tested with `Ellipsis` or `Character`.\r\n\r\nEverything else seems to be working well. I also fully agree with the decision to use generic add/remove control instead of buttons only.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#pullrequestreview-2592222140","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102346","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-04T09:34:28Z"},{"id":2594773819,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6aqRs7","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#pullrequestreview-2594773819","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102346","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-05T06:53:38Z"},{"id":2589322086,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6aVetm","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#pullrequestreview-2589322086","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102346","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-05T12:28:25Z"},{"id":2606821174,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bYO82","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#pullrequestreview-2606821174","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102346","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-10T18:34:55Z"},{"id":2606822729,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bYPVJ","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nThis is handy for editor plugins, non-game applications, but also games with complex UIs like management games. It's also helpful to make ImGui-style debug menus in games. It's not very accessible on a controller, but it's OK on a keyboard (since you can use <kbd>Tab</kbd> and <kbd>Shift + Tab</kbd>.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_102346.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18739015/test_pr_102346.zip)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77c680e4-32d1-4e66-a605-dbff7fb00833\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- The title height changes if there's no text, which looks a bit strange when you're typing titles in the editor. To avoid this, you could set the minimum height to the font ascent of the title font by querying it with TextServer. Notice how the last FoldableContainer is smaller compared to the others:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04dda8c4-c9bf-4967-9e59-69b1981f62cb)\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#pullrequestreview-2606822729","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102346","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-10T18:35:42Z"},{"id":2619206559,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6cHeuf","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?u=91917e0336efbc8ad71e04d9911dd4630689f968&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","login":"WhalesState","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#pullrequestreview-2619206559","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102346","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-02-15T01:22:29Z"},{"id":2743731505,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6jigUx","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"ht